\section{Vibrational and Rotational Spectroscopy (VRS)}
This is a new contributed topic on Spectroscopy, focused primarily on Vibrational Spectroscopy and Vibro-rotational spectroscopy, including but not limited to:

\begin{itemize}
\item Infrared Spectroscopy (IR)
\item Near Infrared Spectroscopy (NIR)
\item Raman scattering
\item Microwave Spectroscopy (MS)
\item Fourier transform spectroscopy
\item Chemical-Hyperspectral Imaging
\item Fluorescence Correlation Spectroscopy (FCS) and FCCS
\item Vibrational Circular Dichroism (VCD)
\item Neutron Spectroscopy
\item Extended X-ray Absorpion Fine Structure (EXAFS)
\item new3
\item new4
\item new5
\item new6
\item new7

\end{itemize}

\subsection{See also:}
